        "TileImage": "$($repository 7efcc3f9-6ee4-4b86-9a3b-7489195ce434).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47. Your destination is the Haven island in the Maldives, a holiday resort for criminals to &quot;disappear&quot;. Your target is Mitch Nocannon and his accomplice Ashley Montague. They have murdered a young man named Jason Bay, and our client wants revenge. We can not afford collateral damage on this one. Try not to pacify/eliminate any more people than the targets. Good luck, 47.",
